@title: A box is picked by its caption
STEP 1: Checkboxes without labels
    NAVIGATE to @SITE@/checkboxes.html
    UNCHECK the checkbox for 'checkbox 2'
    VERIFY that 'checkbox 2' is NOT checked
    CHECK the checkbox for 'checkbox 1'
    VERIFY that 'checkbox 1' is checked
    VERIFY that 'checkbox 2' is NOT checked
STEP 2: A full-width caption leads to the field under it
    VERIFY 'Number' field has value '42'
    FILL 'Number' field with '7'
    VERIFY 'Number' field has value '7'
DONE.
